(1922480, 265479, 8624, '<td valign="top">very clever! they certainly look menacing. I like the "Kilroy was here" expression of your frightened model. Tones are a little blah - I would have liked more contrast on the wall, but still a fun image. well done.</td>', 'very clever! they certainly look menacing. I like the "Kilroy was here" expression of your frightened model. Tones are a little blah - I would have liked more contrast on the wall, but still a fun image. well done.', '2005-12-05 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922482, 265260, 3080, '<td valign="top">Don''t you hate it when you forget to check your title only to find out after the challenge starts that you have terribly screwed it up. ;)<br/>As for the photo itself, I can''t imaging why there would ever be a flower on a fork.  Seems way out of place to me.  the reflection is ok.  i wish the background were just a bit darker.  There is a shadow from the flower in the background just above the fork, and a bit of texture in the blackness in the lower left corner.  Focus is alright on the fork and the flower.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Don''t you hate it when you forget to check your title only to find out after the challenge starts that you have terribly screwed it up. ;)As for the photo itself, I can''t imaging why there would ever be a flower on a fork.  Seems way out of place to me.  the reflection is ok.  i wish the background were just a bit darker.  There is a shadow from the flower in the background just above the fork, and a bit of texture in the blackness in the lower left corner.  Focus is alright on the fork and the flower.  ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 00:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922483, 265264, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice macro - good use of strong graphic elements in the tomato and dark fork tines. the hot spot distracts a bit, but not too much.</td>', 'nice macro - good use of strong graphic elements in the tomato and dark fork tines. the hot spot distracts a bit, but not too much.', '2005-12-05 00:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922485, 264598, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I love this.  It''d my favorite. 10</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I love this.  It''d my favorite. 10', '2005-12-05 00:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922487, 264773, 8624, '<td valign="top">very minimalist. I like it! your cropping is good, placing the pea well in the bottom 3rd of the frame.</td>', 'very minimalist. I like it! your cropping is good, placing the pea well in the bottom 3rd of the frame.', '2005-12-05 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922490, 265397, 3080, '<td valign="top">Deffinately different.  That''s a whole lot of reflection for something so small.  The pink around the edge is a bit of distraction to me.  It''s not so bad on the girls sweatshirt, but around the edge of the spoon, it''s a bit much.  Is this a spoon or a scoop?  I''m thinking it''s a scoop, but oh well, they serve the same purpose I guess.  Focus is good, background is good as well, nothing distracting there.  Fun photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'Deffinately different.  That''s a whole lot of reflection for something so small.  The pink around the edge is a bit of distraction to me.  It''s not so bad on the girls sweatshirt, but around the edge of the spoon, it''s a bit much.  Is this a spoon or a scoop?  I''m thinking it''s a scoop, but oh well, they serve the same purpose I guess.  Focus is good, background is good as well, nothing distracting there.  Fun photo. ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 00:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922491, 265399, 5885, '<td valign="top">Can''t vote... but this is a very interseting pic.  I''m not sure that the toplessness, by itself is good. I''d suggest something more "nighttime" such as pajamas or panties &amp; bra. Color balance is a tad off also.</td>', 'Can''t vote... but this is a very interseting pic.  I''m not sure that the toplessness, by itself is good. I''d suggest something more "nighttime" such as pajamas or panties & bra. Color balance is a tad off also.', '2005-12-05 00:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922494, 265215, 8624, '<td valign="top">good strong graphic elements. I like what you were going for here, but I think the lighting is too strong. It would have been more effective to have some slight reflections on the broad flat surfaces of the handle and tines, but I do like the subtle gradients that are showing.</td>', 'good strong graphic elements. I like what you were going for here, but I think the lighting is too strong. It would have been more effective to have some slight reflections on the broad flat surfaces of the handle and tines, but I do like the subtle gradients that are showing.', '2005-12-05 00:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
