(1922568, 265053, 43437, '<td valign="top">Not the ordinary spoon picture.  I like how you captured the grain of the spoon while it still looks smooth.  I like the shadows on the spoon but wish the one on the floor wasnt there.  The floor adds a nice contrast just wish it didnt have the shadow.  Maybe if the shadow followed one of the floor lines?</td>', 'Not the ordinary spoon picture.  I like how you captured the grain of the spoon while it still looks smooth.  I like the shadows on the spoon but wish the one on the floor wasnt there.  The floor adds a nice contrast just wish it didnt have the shadow.  Maybe if the shadow followed one of the floor lines?', '2005-12-05 01:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922570, 265407, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m so happy to see the colors in the ''right'' order.  So often we see created ''rainbows'' and they''re all mixed up.  Blame it on my OCD to like seeing these in order.  The colors are great.  Nice vivid and bright.  Focus appears to be good as well.  Wish we could have this bigger, but I realize the size limit restricts this, and the crop makes it just that much smaller.  I think this would look great as a huge image hanging up somewhere.<br/>Lighting is good, I don''t see any distractions except the darkish dye to the left of the photo near the purple spoon.  Otherwise, a fun image.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m so happy to see the colors in the ''right'' order.  So often we see created ''rainbows'' and they''re all mixed up.  Blame it on my OCD to like seeing these in order.  The colors are great.  Nice vivid and bright.  Focus appears to be good as well.  Wish we could have this bigger, but I realize the size limit restricts this, and the crop makes it just that much smaller.  I think this would look great as a huge image hanging up somewhere.Lighting is good, I don''t see any distractions except the darkish dye to the left of the photo near the purple spoon.  Otherwise, a fun image.  ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 01:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922572, 264871, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great title. LOL  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great title. LOL  Nicely done.', '2005-12-05 01:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922573, 265348, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love the diea of it. Wish it were more tack sharp. ;~(</td>', 'I just love the diea of it. Wish it were more tack sharp. ;~(', '2005-12-05 01:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922576, 263373, 3080, '<td valign="top">A spoon and fork in ice?  A little difficult to see.  The lighting in the center is harsh, with some blown out areas creating quite a distraction.  Looks like you may have tried to tone it down a bit post processing, but instead, it kind of gave it a greyish look.  Not sure how to recover from that, other than try different lighting.  I wonder, if this were frozen in ice, would a backlighting have made an interesting effect?  ~Heather~</td>', 'A spoon and fork in ice?  A little difficult to see.  The lighting in the center is harsh, with some blown out areas creating quite a distraction.  Looks like you may have tried to tone it down a bit post processing, but instead, it kind of gave it a greyish look.  Not sure how to recover from that, other than try different lighting.  I wonder, if this were frozen in ice, would a backlighting have made an interesting effect?  ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 01:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922577, 265313, 43437, '<td valign="top">Maybe a closer view of the utinsils would have given them more impact.  They are kind of lost in the busy-ness of the picture</td>', 'Maybe a closer view of the utinsils would have given them more impact.  They are kind of lost in the busy-ness of the picture', '2005-12-05 01:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
