(1922651, 265140, 3080, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a very appealing image.  I''m not really sure what it''s suposed to be.  Is that suposed to be blood?  If so, it doesn''t look very much like blood...kind of looks like the guy was eating spaghetti and missed his mouth.  Or maybe barbeque or something.  Anyway, the background elements are also a bit distracting.  There is a horizontal line cutting right through his head in the background.  Maybe if he were trying to pay attention to what he was doing (eating) rather than looking directly into the camera, it might help too.  The 3 different leafy/floral patterns in the photo kind of clash with each other.  The leaves on the plate, the leafy things on the blue couch, and the flowers on the pillow above don''t blend so well.<br/>Focus though is really good, it shows a lot of detail, even wrinkles in the peas and shirt.  Lighting is also decent.  Just not my cup of tea, nothing personal.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This isn''t a very appealing image.  I''m not really sure what it''s suposed to be.  Is that suposed to be blood?  If so, it doesn''t look very much like blood...kind of looks like the guy was eating spaghetti and missed his mouth.  Or maybe barbeque or something.  Anyway, the background elements are also a bit distracting.  There is a horizontal line cutting right through his head in the background.  Maybe if he were trying to pay attention to what he was doing (eating) rather than looking directly into the camera, it might help too.  The 3 different leafy/floral patterns in the photo kind of clash with each other.  The leaves on the plate, the leafy things on the blue couch, and the flowers on the pillow above don''t blend so well.Focus though is really good, it shows a lot of detail, even wrinkles in the peas and shirt.  Lighting is also decent.  Just not my cup of tea, nothing personal.  ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 01:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922658, 265477, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s definately a fork, but I can''t make out anything else.  Is that a spoon under it?  I like the color of the photo, definately mysterious.  DOF seems very narrow and I can''t find anything in that narrow area that really draws my attention and holds it.  The only thing that I really see in focus are some wrinkles on the floor surface.  I wish I could make this out, the effect is neat, maybe it''s suposed to be abstract?  still cool coloring whatever it is.  ~Heather~</td>', 'It''s definately a fork, but I can''t make out anything else.  Is that a spoon under it?  I like the color of the photo, definately mysterious.  DOF seems very narrow and I can''t find anything in that narrow area that really draws my attention and holds it.  The only thing that I really see in focus are some wrinkles on the floor surface.  I wish I could make this out, the effect is neat, maybe it''s suposed to be abstract?  still cool coloring whatever it is.  ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 01:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922662, 265450, 1686, '<td valign="top">more to the point</td>', 'more to the point', '2005-12-05 01:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1922664, 265471, 3080, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA.  Certainly didn''t notice that in the thumbnail.  I wonder if this violates the no penis rule? Hmmm?  LOL.  Very nice focus and clarity, love the idea it''s definately clever and original.  The lighting creates some shadows that are a bit distracting and the texture of the white surface doesn''t add to the image in my opinion either.  Cute.  Made me laugh.  ~Heather~</td>', 'HAHAHA.  Certainly didn''t notice that in the thumbnail.  I wonder if this violates the no penis rule? Hmmm?  LOL.  Very nice focus and clarity, love the idea it''s definately clever and original.  The lighting creates some shadows that are a bit distracting and the texture of the white surface doesn''t add to the image in my opinion either.  Cute.  Made me laugh.  ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 01:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
