(1922681, 265301, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting it.  I mean, it fits the challenge i guess.  Resembles a spoon, but not enough of the photo is in focus to tell what it is.  The spot that I see that is in focus is the corner of the metal thing in the bottom right.  This to me doesn''t seem like it would be the most interesting part of the photo, so I can''t figure out why it would the the crispest focus.  I guess this must have been easier to picture seeing the entire scene and knowing what you were going for.  As is, it''s a bit busy, soft and confusing.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m not getting it.  I mean, it fits the challenge i guess.  Resembles a spoon, but not enough of the photo is in focus to tell what it is.  The spot that I see that is in focus is the corner of the metal thing in the bottom right.  This to me doesn''t seem like it would be the most interesting part of the photo, so I can''t figure out why it would the the crispest focus.  I guess this must have been easier to picture seeing the entire scene and knowing what you were going for.  As is, it''s a bit busy, soft and confusing.  ~Heather~', '2005-12-05 01:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
