(1924432, 265254, 25678, '<td valign="top">This has a great idea, but I''m not a fan of the cropping of the edges of the untensils.  Also, shooting snow is very difficult, and if haven''t already, look into some tutorials on shooting snow.  The snow seems a bit flat in this picture, which is why I''m saying this. (I can''t shoot snow to save my life.  Still trying to figure it out)<br/> <br/>Creative idea!</td>', 'This has a great idea, but I''m not a fan of the cropping of the edges of the untensils.  Also, shooting snow is very difficult, and if haven''t already, look into some tutorials on shooting snow.  The snow seems a bit flat in this picture, which is why I''m saying this. (I can''t shoot snow to save my life.  Still trying to figure it out) Creative idea!', '2005-12-05 15:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924452, 265410, 43674, '<td valign="top">good lighting on this shot, mind you this bloke looks a bit rough to be born with a silver spoon in his mouth</td>', 'good lighting on this shot, mind you this bloke looks a bit rough to be born with a silver spoon in his mouth', '2005-12-05 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924454, 265441, 10413, '<td valign="top">Hey there''s where my missing fork is. Have the same set.  Crisp shot.</td>', 'Hey there''s where my missing fork is. Have the same set.  Crisp shot.', '2005-12-05 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924456, 265216, 10413, '<td valign="top">Cute one.</td>', 'Cute one.', '2005-12-05 15:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924460, 265065, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is good. Clever idea executed well. Nice one!</td>', 'This is good. Clever idea executed well. Nice one!', '2005-12-05 15:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924482, 265381, 17507, '<td valign="top">I take it that you''re illustrating "fork" as in "fork in the road" - it took me a minute to get the link to the challenge. I think that a single fork in the road would have been more illustrative than what looks like part of a switchyard, or what is in any case a more complex arrangement than a branch from one to two lines. overcomplexity is obfuscating your concept.</td>', 'I take it that you''re illustrating "fork" as in "fork in the road" - it took me a minute to get the link to the challenge. I think that a single fork in the road would have been more illustrative than what looks like part of a switchyard, or what is in any case a more complex arrangement than a branch from one to two lines. overcomplexity is obfuscating your concept.', '2005-12-05 15:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924484, 265469, 27763, '<td valign="top">This deserves to ribbon.  Super-clever, and really well done.</td>', 'This deserves to ribbon.  Super-clever, and really well done.', '2005-12-05 15:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924487, 265358, 17507, '<td valign="top">great idea, and a beautiful piece of silverware!</td>', 'great idea, and a beautiful piece of silverware!', '2005-12-05 15:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924494, 264775, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice frost on the bottom of the spoon. Looks like this was a tough shot to get!</td>', 'nice frost on the bottom of the spoon. Looks like this was a tough shot to get!', '2005-12-05 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924499, 264962, 17507, '<td valign="top">punny titles are always good, and this one is clever :) I like this picture and the b/w contrast - though I think a bit closer adherence to the rule of thirds might work a bit better. I feel like there''s a bit too much space on the right and not quite enough on the left.</td>', 'punny titles are always good, and this one is clever :) I like this picture and the b/w contrast - though I think a bit closer adherence to the rule of thirds might work a bit better. I feel like there''s a bit too much space on the right and not quite enough on the left.', '2005-12-05 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924508, 264598, 24013, '<td valign="top">actually really excellent.  love the light and the compositiong and clarity and everything, i just don''t know if i''m interested in seeing the muck in the bowl.  that''s of course just my opinion.  it''s really creative and well done!</td>', 'actually really excellent.  love the light and the compositiong and clarity and everything, i just don''t know if i''m interested in seeing the muck in the bowl.  that''s of course just my opinion.  it''s really creative and well done!', '2005-12-05 15:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
