(1924710, 265065, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is such a lovely concept. It is funny and wacky. Concept=10 and technique=5. Total outcome is 7 1/2. So, you get my seven but these ideas come only once in a great while and I would have worked the lighting to dead. The concept has that ribbon quality and placed the onus on you to deliver paydirt.</td>', 'This is such a lovely concept. It is funny and wacky. Concept=10 and technique=5. Total outcome is 7 1/2. So, you get my seven but these ideas come only once in a great while and I would have worked the lighting to dead. The concept has that ribbon quality and placed the onus on you to deliver paydirt.', '2005-12-05 17:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924714, 265413, 22734, '<td valign="top">An outstanding idea and one image I was going to do in some past challenge with real models. Here you outdid yourself in its presentation because the plastic fork makes this image satisfying and very, very funny. Bumping from six to seven.</td>', 'An outstanding idea and one image I was going to do in some past challenge with real models. Here you outdid yourself in its presentation because the plastic fork makes this image satisfying and very, very funny. Bumping from six to seven.', '2005-12-05 17:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
