(1925009, 265379, 40019, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot!  Very creative take on this challenge by minimizing the challenge subject and bringing out the beauty of the model.  Wonderful lighting, DOF, and textures.  Nicely done.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Incredible shot!  Very creative take on this challenge by minimizing the challenge subject and bringing out the beauty of the model.  Wonderful lighting, DOF, and textures.  Nicely done.  <10>', '2005-12-05 19:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
