(1925012, 264909, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great imagery - nice reflections, wonderful use of NeatImage (or equivalent).</td>', 'Great imagery - nice reflections, wonderful use of NeatImage (or equivalent).', '2005-12-05 19:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925015, 264776, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool and creative!  Love the title (took my a sec to get it)!  DOF and colors really make this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very cool and creative!  Love the title (took my a sec to get it)!  DOF and colors really make this shot.  Nicely done.', '2005-12-05 19:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925016, 265065, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  Very creative!  How long did it take to melt all those spoons? :-)  Great picture, great colors, good DOF...nicely done.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is hilarious!  Very creative!  How long did it take to melt all those spoons? :-)  Great picture, great colors, good DOF...nicely done.  <9>', '2005-12-05 19:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925021, 265471, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, an orange peel on Viagra!  Too funny!  This will be a poster one day (or at least make the email circuit).  Nicely done. &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Wow, an orange peel on Viagra!  Too funny!  This will be a poster one day (or at least make the email circuit).  Nicely done. <9>', '2005-12-05 19:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925024, 265476, 40019, '<td valign="top">Love the theme and set-up!  The pic''s just a little dark.  I''m still giving it a high score though.  Good job.</td>', 'Love the theme and set-up!  The pic''s just a little dark.  I''m still giving it a high score though.  Good job.', '2005-12-05 19:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925025, 264139, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great alternative take on the challenge.  Very nicely done photograph.  I''d like to see the background a little brighter, but thats''s strictly preference.</td>', 'Great alternative take on the challenge.  Very nicely done photograph.  I''d like to see the background a little brighter, but thats''s strictly preference.', '2005-12-05 19:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925028, 264727, 40019, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty tired of water drops, but I like your interpretation - and it''s well executed. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I''m pretty tired of water drops, but I like your interpretation - and it''s well executed. <8>', '2005-12-05 19:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925033, 265456, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup and photograph.  It''s a little soft and has the spot, but very good never the less.</td>', 'Very nice setup and photograph.  It''s a little soft and has the spot, but very good never the less.', '2005-12-05 19:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925036, 264679, 42100, '<td valign="top">A floating fork, very cool photograph.  Nicely done!</td>', 'A floating fork, very cool photograph.  Nicely done!', '2005-12-05 19:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925039, 264775, 40019, '<td valign="top">The attention to detail really made this shot for me.  The clean nails, frost on the spoon, even distribution of ice cream are all great.  Lighting is wonderful, DOF, colors and textures are spot on.  Tilt to landscape was a nice touch as well.  Good job! &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'The attention to detail really made this shot for me.  The clean nails, frost on the spoon, even distribution of ice cream are all great.  Lighting is wonderful, DOF, colors and textures are spot on.  Tilt to landscape was a nice touch as well.  Good job! <8>', '2005-12-05 19:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925041, 265002, 40019, '<td valign="top">The juxtaposition of colors to whites with the soft background are really great. Excellent lighting and DOF.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'The juxtaposition of colors to whites with the soft background are really great. Excellent lighting and DOF.  <8>', '2005-12-05 19:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925042, 265376, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and photograph.  I''d almost prefer it to be a little less abstract, but I still like it alot.  Great work!</td>', 'Nice setup and photograph.  I''d almost prefer it to be a little less abstract, but I still like it alot.  Great work!', '2005-12-05 19:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925044, 265413, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ha, clever!  Grainyness for the canvass feeling was nicely done.  I''m actually going to rate one of these woody pictures high for once!  Nice job.</td>', 'Ha, clever!  Grainyness for the canvass feeling was nicely done.  I''m actually going to rate one of these woody pictures high for once!  Nice job.', '2005-12-05 19:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925048, 265264, 49132, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-12-05 19:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1925050, 265407, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colors, very creative.  Stronger lighting to make the paper whiter would have been nice - would have really made the colors pop.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice use of colors, very creative.  Stronger lighting to make the paper whiter would have been nice - would have really made the colors pop.  <7>', '2005-12-05 19:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
