(1925993, 265436, 47117, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to tell you why I voted this a "one", as many believe that comments should be given in such circumstances. 1) I don''t like the fact that you used some kind of log to show in the entry; especially one in which shows profanity, and also mentions what you should do for your challenge. 2.) Baseball Forking was also done in this challenge and it is mentioned in the log, which may actually influence voters to vote that photo down since it is said in the log that "it is lame".  I find both instances to be influencing voters by discussing it previously with another,(DPC''er or not, as it is cohaboration being actually shown), and showing it on screen as to your own entry as well as that of the Baseball Forking entry.  Your wooden man also seems to be waving, as if to tell that person you wrote to "here I am, doing just what we discussed", which to me takes away possible anonymity.  Of course, this is just my take on it, but I really don''t believe this entry is a suitable one by being profane, or by the influencial remarks.</td>', 'I just wanted to tell you why I voted this a "one", as many believe that comments should be given in such circumstances. 1) I don''t like the fact that you used some kind of log to show in the entry; especially one in which shows profanity, and also mentions what you should do for your challenge. 2.) Baseball Forking was also done in this challenge and it is mentioned in the log, which may actually influence voters to vote that photo down since it is said in the log that "it is lame".  I find both instances to be influencing voters by discussing it previously with another,(DPC''er or not, as it is cohaboration being actually shown), and showing it on screen as to your own entry as well as that of the Baseball Forking entry.  Your wooden man also seems to be waving, as if to tell that person you wrote to "here I am, doing just what we discussed", which to me takes away possible anonymity.  Of course, this is just my take on it, but I really don''t believe this entry is a suitable one by being profane, or by the influencial remarks.', '2005-12-06 00:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
