(1926095, 264599, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Your discipline and technical skills are obvious. Great results! It''s coo; to see how the water droplets moved during the swing. The title, however......</td>', 'Great photo! Your discipline and technical skills are obvious. Great results! It''s coo; to see how the water droplets moved during the swing. The title, however......', '2005-12-06 00:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
