(1926356, 264599, 39560, '<td valign="top">Great photo nice effect. I smell oranges now</td>', 'Great photo nice effect. I smell oranges now', '2005-12-06 03:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926366, 263718, 39560, '<td valign="top">I love the Matrix. Cool photo and cute little boy. Good job. Bump to 7</td>', 'I love the Matrix. Cool photo and cute little boy. Good job. Bump to 7', '2005-12-06 03:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926370, 265380, 24983, '<td valign="top">cool idea man 10</td>', 'cool idea man 10', '2005-12-06 03:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926374, 265065, 39560, '<td valign="top">I think the background should''ve been a little whiter and the colors brighter to make the spoons stand out more. Very creative. 6</td>', 'I think the background should''ve been a little whiter and the colors brighter to make the spoons stand out more. Very creative. 6', '2005-12-06 03:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926379, 265251, 39560, '<td valign="top">Simple yet nice. A little bright. 6</td>', 'Simple yet nice. A little bright. 6', '2005-12-06 03:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926420, 264402, 29474, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours. The bright spot on the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Interesting colours. The bright spot on the background is a bit distracting.', '2005-12-06 04:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926444, 265270, 29474, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen the whole spoon in focus. The drop falling off the spoon would be nicely set off against the stream falling onto it. And a little more space at the bottom?</td>', 'I would like to have seen the whole spoon in focus. The drop falling off the spoon would be nicely set off against the stream falling onto it. And a little more space at the bottom?', '2005-12-06 04:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926506, 265065, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good concept and creative, if this is original, well done.  Criticism; the cropping mainly, also I think that if this had a more offset lighting, a slightly softer focus and a better depth of field, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps the egg even ''raw'', who knows, but that was your call.  Perhaps a slightly sharper angle too, not sure.</td>', '7 - Good concept and creative, if this is original, well done.  Criticism; the cropping mainly, also I think that if this had a more offset lighting, a slightly softer focus and a better depth of field, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps the egg even ''raw'', who knows, but that was your call.  Perhaps a slightly sharper angle too, not sure.', '2005-12-06 05:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926508, 265053, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this.  Criticism; perhaps slightly more handle may have made this even better in my opinion, not sure.  I also wonder about the flooring, ''works'' and also gives a complementary pattern, and colors (mostly), but wonder if either slightly softer on the flooring, or perhaps even some type of desaturation, even if only slight, may have also made this ''pop'' more.</td>', '7 - Like this.  Criticism; perhaps slightly more handle may have made this even better in my opinion, not sure.  I also wonder about the flooring, ''works'' and also gives a complementary pattern, and colors (mostly), but wonder if either slightly softer on the flooring, or perhaps even some type of desaturation, even if only slight, may have also made this ''pop'' more.', '2005-12-06 05:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926513, 265469, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good effort and idea and well done if this is original.  Criticism; of course the classic ''a fly in my soup'', but much harder to execute especially given your ''utensils''.  Seems you have gone to a lot of trouble to set this up.  Right down to (I presume) the choice of shirt on the ''bug''.  Perhaps some type of ''toning down'', or ''softening'' of the ''bug'', so that it was a little more subtle, coupled with a slightly different crop/framing, especially to gain more ''context'' (difficult I am sure as you likely were on a ladder to do this, who knows), may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good effort and idea and well done if this is original.  Criticism; of course the classic ''a fly in my soup'', but much harder to execute especially given your ''utensils''.  Seems you have gone to a lot of trouble to set this up.  Right down to (I presume) the choice of shirt on the ''bug''.  Perhaps some type of ''toning down'', or ''softening'' of the ''bug'', so that it was a little more subtle, coupled with a slightly different crop/framing, especially to gain more ''context'' (difficult I am sure as you likely were on a ladder to do this, who knows), may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-06 05:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926514, 265301, 29474, '<td valign="top">I cannot see what this picture is about. Therefore I can''t relate it to the challenge. It looks like a picture that would be taken when you accidentally press the shutter button.<br/> <br/> <br/>That all said, I could just be close-minded, blind or just plain obtuse and there really is a rational explanation for this picture.</td>', 'I cannot see what this picture is about. Therefore I can''t relate it to the challenge. It looks like a picture that would be taken when you accidentally press the shutter button.  That all said, I could just be close-minded, blind or just plain obtuse and there really is a rational explanation for this picture.', '2005-12-06 05:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926518, 265441, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is the third one of these that I have voted on. And like the others I wonder whether they would have been stronger with a real fork in the road in the background? This is the simplest and cleanest of the three.</td>', 'This is the third one of these that I have voted on. And like the others I wonder whether they would have been stronger with a real fork in the road in the background? This is the simplest and cleanest of the three.', '2005-12-06 05:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926519, 265407, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Really like the use of (and choice in sequence of) colors here and surrounding  ''arrangements''.  Criticism; difficult, as the ''wide''/horizontal framing works well, obviously better ''wall size'', but perhaps ''here'', a little more height, possibly bottom or just top, or maybe even both, may have made this better in my opinion, not sure.  The symmetry is slightly higher on the left, but that may also just be the angle.</td>', '7 - Really like the use of (and choice in sequence of) colors here and surrounding  ''arrangements''.  Criticism; difficult, as the ''wide''/horizontal framing works well, obviously better ''wall size'', but perhaps ''here'', a little more height, possibly bottom or just top, or maybe even both, may have made this better in my opinion, not sure.  The symmetry is slightly higher on the left, but that may also just be the angle.', '2005-12-06 05:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926524, 265263, 23394, '<td valign="top">you are mad</td>', 'you are mad', '2005-12-06 05:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926525, 265451, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the capture and the unusual (and seemingly uniform) pattern on the spoon face.  Toning works well.  Criticism; a few ''imperfections'' here and there on the ''face'', but may just be reflections and I am undecided if they add or detract from this shot.  Perhaps a slightly different ''composition'' arrangement may have made this even better but not sure on that as this works well as is.  The background ''adds'' an unusual element, just like to see the spoon handle ''pop'' a little more at the top there against it.</td>', '7 - Like the capture and the unusual (and seemingly uniform) pattern on the spoon face.  Toning works well.  Criticism; a few ''imperfections'' here and there on the ''face'', but may just be reflections and I am undecided if they add or detract from this shot.  Perhaps a slightly different ''composition'' arrangement may have made this even better but not sure on that as this works well as is.  The background ''adds'' an unusual element, just like to see the spoon handle ''pop'' a little more at the top there against it.', '2005-12-06 05:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926526, 265098, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really really really like this shot, in particular the texture and the lighting, especially on his face.  Somehow this just speaks to me.  Gave this a 10 and added it to my favorites.</td>', 'I really really really like this shot, in particular the texture and the lighting, especially on his face.  Somehow this just speaks to me.  Gave this a 10 and added it to my favorites.', '2005-12-06 05:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926527, 263442, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the effect and the toning and ''feel''.  Criticism; minor but don''t think your title ''adds to this effect'' as much as another, possibly more ''simple'' one may have.  Likely difficult, but if that ''fork'' was more dominant and dramatized more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different/sharper angle too, not sure.</td>', '7 - Like the effect and the toning and ''feel''.  Criticism; minor but don''t think your title ''adds to this effect'' as much as another, possibly more ''simple'' one may have.  Likely difficult, but if that ''fork'' was more dominant and dramatized more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different/sharper angle too, not sure.', '2005-12-06 05:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926528, 265373, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent potential, but the focus is a bit soft.  you might want to check out e301''s spoon (if you haven''t already).</td>', 'excellent potential, but the focus is a bit soft.  you might want to check out e301''s spoon (if you haven''t already).', '2005-12-06 05:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926530, 265380, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very creative and if this is original, very well done.  Criticism; difficult, I do like this but think that it has more potential than you have captured, but no idea how to do so.  Perhaps a toning or even b/w (despite losing the color in the ''accessories''), may have made this even better in my opinion.  The ''mottled'' flesh/skin (especially at the top) perhaps detracts slightly too, but minor.  Just noticed, either this person has a little toe missing on their left foot or another shoot to include it was needed.</td>', '7 - Very creative and if this is original, very well done.  Criticism; difficult, I do like this but think that it has more potential than you have captured, but no idea how to do so.  Perhaps a toning or even b/w (despite losing the color in the ''accessories''), may have made this even better in my opinion.  The ''mottled'' flesh/skin (especially at the top) perhaps detracts slightly too, but minor.  Just noticed, either this person has a little toe missing on their left foot or another shoot to include it was needed.', '2005-12-06 05:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926533, 263289, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is chaos to the eye.  even if you placed the fork there, there is too much going on, almost as if you simply opened up a drawer of spoons, stuck in a fork, and popped the shutter.  it would appear that there is also a knife in there.  if this doesn''t do well, take the score as encouragement not to just point your camera at something that looks on topic, but instead, to take some time to plan out your shot.</td>', 'this is chaos to the eye.  even if you placed the fork there, there is too much going on, almost as if you simply opened up a drawer of spoons, stuck in a fork, and popped the shutter.  it would appear that there is also a knife in there.  if this doesn''t do well, take the score as encouragement not to just point your camera at something that looks on topic, but instead, to take some time to plan out your shot.', '2005-12-06 05:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926534, 265454, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice, good desaturation,  nice colorings.  Criticism; perhaps (depending on the true color) more of a vivid green as is the blue and perhaps a slightly different crop, especially on the right to try to eliminate that ''bank''/edge, may have also made this better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Very nice, good desaturation,  nice colorings.  Criticism; perhaps (depending on the true color) more of a vivid green as is the blue and perhaps a slightly different crop, especially on the right to try to eliminate that ''bank''/edge, may have also made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-06 05:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926535, 263996, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice and ''clean''.  Criticism; although the reflections in the spoon add an interest/element, not sure if they enhance this shot.  I also cannot decipher the ''elixir'' as much as I wish I could and it in fact may just be a desaturated reflection.  If it is a liquid, then I think completely filling the spoon (and obviously then needing to prop it up level on the end of the handle) may have made this even better in my opinion.  But this may not be the case nor your intent at all.</td>', '7 - Nice and ''clean''.  Criticism; although the reflections in the spoon add an interest/element, not sure if they enhance this shot.  I also cannot decipher the ''elixir'' as much as I wish I could and it in fact may just be a desaturated reflection.  If it is a liquid, then I think completely filling the spoon (and obviously then needing to prop it up level on the end of the handle) may have made this even better in my opinion.  But this may not be the case nor your intent at all.', '2005-12-06 05:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1926536, 264991, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m sure you had fun experimenting with this.  it probably would do better if it had been cropped all the way into the forks, so that you couldn''t see the foil.</td>', 'i''m sure you had fun experimenting with this.  it probably would do better if it had been cropped all the way into the forks, so that you couldn''t see the foil.', '2005-12-06 05:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
