(1926538, 265454, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge, should be interesting to see where this winds up.  you have the eye, equipment, and skill to do whatever you want--i guess you enjoy trying to get dpc to get out of the box ;-)</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge, should be interesting to see where this winds up.  you have the eye, equipment, and skill to do whatever you want--i guess you enjoy trying to get dpc to get out of the box ;-)', '2005-12-06 05:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
