(1927184, 263442, 34659, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity - beautiful shot.  Love the tones.</td>', 'Amazing clarity - beautiful shot.  Love the tones.', '2005-12-06 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927224, 265376, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition, like the pattern and tones in this image, you got an 8 from me.</td>', 'Nice repetition, like the pattern and tones in this image, you got an 8 from me.', '2005-12-06 12:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927258, 265458, 42714, '<td valign="top">Ha.  Love the twist on words to describe the objects here.</td>', 'Ha.  Love the twist on words to describe the objects here.', '2005-12-06 12:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927260, 264969, 42714, '<td valign="top">Think there''s a few things that need working on here...one, is composition.  The objects seem to have no purposeful placement and there''s little proportion to the photography.  Also, the combination of carrots and kitchen utensils seem cluttered.  Second, is lighting.  You probably need two sources of lighting, or one major source of light to really bring anything out like this.</td>', 'Think there''s a few things that need working on here...one, is composition.  The objects seem to have no purposeful placement and there''s little proportion to the photography.  Also, the combination of carrots and kitchen utensils seem cluttered.  Second, is lighting.  You probably need two sources of lighting, or one major source of light to really bring anything out like this.', '2005-12-06 12:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927264, 265205, 42714, '<td valign="top">Was hoping someone would experiment with tin foil and reflection of light, but wasn''t anticipating adding water to the mix.  Good job with the composition and installation.  I do think because of your reliance on detail in this instance, t could use some sharper focus in places (you can see the focus start to blur in the upper-left-hand-corner)</td>', 'Was hoping someone would experiment with tin foil and reflection of light, but wasn''t anticipating adding water to the mix.  Good job with the composition and installation.  I do think because of your reliance on detail in this instance, t could use some sharper focus in places (you can see the focus start to blur in the upper-left-hand-corner)', '2005-12-06 12:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927270, 265409, 42714, '<td valign="top">Food shots are verrrry difficult.  Wonderful work with this one.</td>', 'Food shots are verrrry difficult.  Wonderful work with this one.', '2005-12-06 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927282, 265065, 42714, '<td valign="top">This is downright funny and creative.  For that, I give you major props.  Unfortunately, this is dark...suffers from either poor lighting or underexposure.</td>', 'This is downright funny and creative.  For that, I give you major props.  Unfortunately, this is dark...suffers from either poor lighting or underexposure.', '2005-12-06 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927295, 263067, 42714, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting, and just poor focus here.  Would recommend using a tripod, or if you don''t have one, taking a deep breath and at the moment you completely inhale, depress your shutter.</td>', 'Poor lighting, and just poor focus here.  Would recommend using a tripod, or if you don''t have one, taking a deep breath and at the moment you completely inhale, depress your shutter.', '2005-12-06 12:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927296, 265398, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast if you ask me, there is little or no texture in large portions of the shot so I find it hard to rate this shot fairly...</td>', 'Too much contrast if you ask me, there is little or no texture in large portions of the shot so I find it hard to rate this shot fairly...', '2005-12-06 12:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927304, 262928, 42714, '<td valign="top">This is one of those instances I would recommend cropping away the table edge, even though it''s in your original photo.  It would place a little bit more emphasis on your objects, make for a more concise composition (with less colors and fewer objects) and besides, you can see the rest of the table''s flat surface int he background.</td>', 'This is one of those instances I would recommend cropping away the table edge, even though it''s in your original photo.  It would place a little bit more emphasis on your objects, make for a more concise composition (with less colors and fewer objects) and besides, you can see the rest of the table''s flat surface int he background.', '2005-12-06 12:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927313, 265068, 42714, '<td valign="top">A couple of things.  Cute composition, but this picture is completely unreliant on the spoon and fork.  Second, is the top-left hand corner, you have some shadow and just a hint of another object.   Would remove any surrounding objects that might be a distration  before the shot.</td>', 'A couple of things.  Cute composition, but this picture is completely unreliant on the spoon and fork.  Second, is the top-left hand corner, you have some shadow and just a hint of another object.   Would remove any surrounding objects that might be a distration  before the shot.', '2005-12-06 12:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927877, 263855, 32338, '<td valign="top">Unusual and creative</td>', 'Unusual and creative', '2005-12-06 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1927878, 264773, 32338, '<td valign="top">Whoa, that''s a bit depressing.</td>', 'Whoa, that''s a bit depressing.', '2005-12-06 15:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
