(1929028, 265065, 27763, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Really, really clever.  Great job with the setup, too.  My one nitpick is that the lighting seems a bit flat.  There aren''t really any whites.  Just midtones and darks.  Even the white of the egg seems more yellowy than white.  But still, I''m very impressed with your creativity.</td>', 'Awesome!  Really, really clever.  Great job with the setup, too.  My one nitpick is that the lighting seems a bit flat.  There aren''t really any whites.  Just midtones and darks.  Even the white of the egg seems more yellowy than white.  But still, I''m very impressed with your creativity.', '2005-12-06 21:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1929060, 265458, 27763, '<td valign="top">More like "forking"  ;)<br/> <br/>In the future, you probably will want to size your photo such that the longest dimension is 640 pixels, to take advantage of the max allowable size.   Yours is only 357 pixels.  Voters get very turned off by small photos, for some reason.  Other than that, this is a nice shot!  <br/> <br/></td>', 'More like "forking"  ;) In the future, you probably will want to size your photo such that the longest dimension is 640 pixels, to take advantage of the max allowable size.   Yours is only 357 pixels.  Voters get very turned off by small photos, for some reason.  Other than that, this is a nice shot!   ', '2005-12-06 21:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1929138, 264919, 27763, '<td valign="top">Cool headgear thingie.  I bet this would look great in black and white.</td>', 'Cool headgear thingie.  I bet this would look great in black and white.', '2005-12-06 21:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1929175, 264871, 27763, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Good lighting, and effective use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Nice.  Good lighting, and effective use of shallow DOF.', '2005-12-06 21:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
