(1929186, 265377, 27763, '<td valign="top">I like this composition.  The large field of white, the smaller field of paper, interrupted by the interestingly placed knife.  (My wife just glanced over my shoulder, looking at your photo, and she said "Oooh!  Cool!")<br/></td>', 'I like this composition.  The large field of white, the smaller field of paper, interrupted by the interestingly placed knife.  (My wife just glanced over my shoulder, looking at your photo, and she said "Oooh!  Cool!")', '2005-12-06 21:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
