(1930046, 265202, 27767, '<td valign="top">I see the spoon and fork, but I don''t see the knife that your title suggests. The reflections add some interest. The bright line in back (the knife maybe?) is a little distracting from the two primary subjects.</td>', 'I see the spoon and fork, but I don''t see the knife that your title suggests. The reflections add some interest. The bright line in back (the knife maybe?) is a little distracting from the two primary subjects.', '2005-12-07 01:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
