(1930056, 262902, 27767, '<td valign="top">This composition is a little to busy for me.  The painting on the object to the far right seems to draw the most attention, but doesn''t appear to be a main subject.  I think simplifying this shot could bring out it''s real message better.</td>', 'This composition is a little to busy for me.  The painting on the object to the far right seems to draw the most attention, but doesn''t appear to be a main subject.  I think simplifying this shot could bring out it''s real message better.', '2005-12-07 01:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1930060, 265065, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.  I like the composition and how all the spoons draw attention to the egg.</td>', 'Very creative idea.  I like the composition and how all the spoons draw attention to the egg.', '2005-12-07 01:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
