(1930078, 263373, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The bright highlight going through the middle of the shot is a little distracting to me. Maybe softer light and a slightly darker exposure would bring out some interesting details</td>', 'Interesting idea. The bright highlight going through the middle of the shot is a little distracting to me. Maybe softer light and a slightly darker exposure would bring out some interesting details', '2005-12-07 01:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
