(1933956, 265469, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cute. It wouldn''t surprise me if this got a ribbon especially since this type of photography usually does well here. Personally, I don''t really care too much for it but it is well done thus I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Cute. It wouldn''t surprise me if this got a ribbon especially since this type of photography usually does well here. Personally, I don''t really care too much for it but it is well done thus I gave it a 7.', '2005-12-07 22:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
