(1934012, 265379, 41337, '<td valign="top">The model has great eyes and seems to be the focus of this shot. I know you''re suppose to have the eyes in focus when shooting a face this close but being how this is a challenge about utensils I think you needed to also get the fork in focus also especially when it''s suppose to be the point of the shot.</td>', 'The model has great eyes and seems to be the focus of this shot. I know you''re suppose to have the eyes in focus when shooting a face this close but being how this is a challenge about utensils I think you needed to also get the fork in focus also especially when it''s suppose to be the point of the shot.', '2005-12-07 22:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1934226, 265454, 42826, '<td valign="top">i love what you have done with the coloring...that is awesome!</td>', 'i love what you have done with the coloring...that is awesome!', '2005-12-07 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1934233, 262979, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool use of three, enhanced by the red lighting.</td>', 'Cool use of three, enhanced by the red lighting.', '2005-12-07 23:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
