(1937360, 264871, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry and the angle you have taken the shot. Excellent lighting as well.</td>', 'I like the symmetry and the angle you have taken the shot. Excellent lighting as well.', '2005-12-09 06:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937363, 264611, 318, '<td valign="top">Little less cropping on the left, and perhaps more on the right, to emphaiza the fork part...</td>', 'Little less cropping on the left, and perhaps more on the right, to emphaiza the fork part...', '2005-12-09 06:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937364, 264878, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup. Very difficult to get it right. You have done well.</td>', 'Interesting setup. Very difficult to get it right. You have done well.', '2005-12-09 06:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937366, 265441, 318, '<td valign="top">It actually works for me. The rough road vs. the smooth metal.</td>', 'It actually works for me. The rough road vs. the smooth metal.', '2005-12-09 07:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937367, 264878, 318, '<td valign="top">Not too bad. But the sppons look like they are matte.</td>', 'Not too bad. But the sppons look like they are matte.', '2005-12-09 07:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937368, 264969, 318, '<td valign="top">Not very good, the lightning is horrible, too dark and hard.</td>', 'Not very good, the lightning is horrible, too dark and hard.', '2005-12-09 07:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937376, 264857, 318, '<td valign="top">A bit soft, and I don''t like the greenish cast.</td>', 'A bit soft, and I don''t like the greenish cast.', '2005-12-09 07:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937387, 264919, 318, '<td valign="top">That is a bit sinister. A bit flat though, maybe better light, or B/W would have made this photo better?</td>', 'That is a bit sinister. A bit flat though, maybe better light, or B/W would have made this photo better?', '2005-12-09 07:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937388, 265240, 318, '<td valign="top">I think the yellow whatever-it-is spoils this photo. Just the plates with the utensils would make this a very ''zen'' photo. Still, well above average.</td>', 'I think the yellow whatever-it-is spoils this photo. Just the plates with the utensils would make this a very ''zen'' photo. Still, well above average.', '2005-12-09 07:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937392, 265248, 318, '<td valign="top">10 for colours.</td>', '10 for colours.', '2005-12-09 07:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937400, 265040, 318, '<td valign="top">Some strange softness, and connection to the theme is stretching...</td>', 'Some strange softness, and connection to the theme is stretching...', '2005-12-09 07:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937403, 264599, 318, '<td valign="top">The drops on the knife is a nice touch, however the shadow on the orange is a bit distracting</td>', 'The drops on the knife is a nice touch, however the shadow on the orange is a bit distracting', '2005-12-09 07:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937410, 265379, 30881, '<td valign="top">Normally portraits this close up tend to blur, glare, etc. This is extremely well done and the idea is very imaginative and interesting. Certainly gets viewers attention. Hope it scores high for you. Good luck</td>', 'Normally portraits this close up tend to blur, glare, etc. This is extremely well done and the idea is very imaginative and interesting. Certainly gets viewers attention. Hope it scores high for you. Good luck', '2005-12-09 08:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937414, 263373, 318, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but not very good technically. The light is not good, there are burnouts and washouts...</td>', 'Nice idea, but not very good technically. The light is not good, there are burnouts and washouts...', '2005-12-09 08:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937416, 265140, 30881, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Unfortunately your make up artist ruined the photo for you. If the tomato sauce is actually supposed to be blood it shouldn''t be that smeared and it shouldn''t have the light bouncing off it on his throat. A great attempt and shows geat imagination. Good luck</td>', 'Great idea. Unfortunately your make up artist ruined the photo for you. If the tomato sauce is actually supposed to be blood it shouldn''t be that smeared and it shouldn''t have the light bouncing off it on his throat. A great attempt and shows geat imagination. Good luck', '2005-12-09 08:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937419, 264906, 318, '<td valign="top">Very good, the the hard light makes the micro-scratches of the utensils visible</td>', 'Very good, the the hard light makes the micro-scratches of the utensils visible', '2005-12-09 08:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937420, 265476, 318, '<td valign="top">Too dark/murky.</td>', 'Too dark/murky.', '2005-12-09 08:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937421, 265065, 318, '<td valign="top">+2 for humour. Perhaps little underexposed?</td>', '+2 for humour. Perhaps little underexposed?', '2005-12-09 08:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937428, 265002, 30881, '<td valign="top">What a brilliant idea !! Great imaginative shot and well executed. Perhaps a touch sharper and a more solid blurred background. Certainly deserves a high finish  Good luck !!</td>', 'What a brilliant idea !! Great imaginative shot and well executed. Perhaps a touch sharper and a more solid blurred background. Certainly deserves a high finish  Good luck !!', '2005-12-09 08:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937429, 265208, 318, '<td valign="top">Lovley yellows. The ''Giant'' factor isn''t working for me, I think you need bigger cup or something.</td>', 'Lovley yellows. The ''Giant'' factor isn''t working for me, I think you need bigger cup or something.', '2005-12-09 08:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937432, 265453, 318, '<td valign="top">+ Nice sharp macro. <br/>- bad cyan/magneta cast <br/>- bad shadow</td>', '+ Nice sharp macro. - bad cyan/magneta cast - bad shadow', '2005-12-09 08:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937435, 265399, 30881, '<td valign="top">The first word that comes to mind - "Exhibitionist"  Just don''t understand why anyone would look out a large window half dressed. Don''t know why you want to show off your tattoo.<br/>Lighting effects really destroy this image and seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'The first word that comes to mind - "Exhibitionist"  Just don''t understand why anyone would look out a large window half dressed. Don''t know why you want to show off your tattoo.Lighting effects really destroy this image and seems a bit out of focus.', '2005-12-09 08:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937439, 265471, 30881, '<td valign="top">"" You Wish "" !! Very poor taste. There are young children on this site and I personally think this is a pathetic attempt at humor. Try concentrating a little more on lighting and focus, rather than eroticism.</td>', '"" You Wish "" !! Very poor taste. There are young children on this site and I personally think this is a pathetic attempt at humor. Try concentrating a little more on lighting and focus, rather than eroticism.', '2005-12-09 08:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937444, 264735, 30881, '<td valign="top">I just knew when I saw the word knife, someone would have to jump into the world of violence. With 10 year old children being members on this site,  I think a more mature and socially accepted image could have been entered. Perhaps concentrate on the quality of the photo, lighting sharper focus improved backgrounds etc. <br/>.</td>', 'I just knew when I saw the word knife, someone would have to jump into the world of violence. With 10 year old children being members on this site,  I think a more mature and socially accepted image could have been entered. Perhaps concentrate on the quality of the photo, lighting sharper focus improved backgrounds etc. .', '2005-12-09 08:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937450, 265260, 30881, '<td valign="top">Wow!! Realism (the actual flower) to Surrealistic modernism (the reflection) A great imaginative photo and very good execution. If this doesn''t make it to ribbon it should at least be in the top five. For creativity alone ! Well done.</td>', 'Wow!! Realism (the actual flower) to Surrealistic modernism (the reflection) A great imaginative photo and very good execution. If this doesn''t make it to ribbon it should at least be in the top five. For creativity alone ! Well done.', '2005-12-09 08:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937464, 265410, 30881, '<td valign="top">Your model certainly doesn''t appear to have been granted the worldly wonders received from the silver spoon. Great contradiction to an old fable. Would have liked the photo better if the spoon wasn''t partly cropped out of the image. The in your face attitude works for me but perhaps not quite "so up close and personal"</td>', 'Your model certainly doesn''t appear to have been granted the worldly wonders received from the silver spoon. Great contradiction to an old fable. Would have liked the photo better if the spoon wasn''t partly cropped out of the image. The in your face attitude works for me but perhaps not quite "so up close and personal"', '2005-12-09 09:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937469, 265216, 30881, '<td valign="top">A very very cute idea. Just great. I think the lighting could have been improved on though.</td>', 'A very very cute idea. Just great. I think the lighting could have been improved on though.', '2005-12-09 09:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937494, 265380, 21816, '<td valign="top">This is really original and obviously a lot of work went into it! Well done.</td>', 'This is really original and obviously a lot of work went into it! Well done.', '2005-12-09 09:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937506, 265312, 30881, '<td valign="top">This photo leads me to believe some serious photographic training is needed along with some sociopathic/anger management treatment. Because young children are members at this site I would expect a more  mature imaginative entry. Perhaps browse the archive and see just what form/style of photography wins ribbons.</td>', 'This photo leads me to believe some serious photographic training is needed along with some sociopathic/anger management treatment. Because young children are members at this site I would expect a more  mature imaginative entry. Perhaps browse the archive and see just what form/style of photography wins ribbons.', '2005-12-09 09:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937514, 265436, 30881, '<td valign="top">Nice to see your imaginative photo works so well with the title Definitely no confusion here. lol</td>', 'Nice to see your imaginative photo works so well with the title Definitely no confusion here. lol', '2005-12-09 09:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937532, 265469, 30881, '<td valign="top">This is just too too funny. What a great idea. The shovel and pitch fork make great added humor. Well done indee.</td>', 'This is just too too funny. What a great idea. The shovel and pitch fork make great added humor. Well done indee.', '2005-12-09 09:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937536, 265413, 30881, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully humourous !! A little tweeking here and there, but overall my favourite for imaginative layout</td>', 'Wonderfully humourous !! A little tweeking here and there, but overall my favourite for imaginative layout', '2005-12-09 09:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937548, 265301, 30881, '<td valign="top">I know I can be a bit thick between the ears, but I just don''t get the title matching the photo. <br/>Obviously a hidden mesage there somewhere.</td>', 'I know I can be a bit thick between the ears, but I just don''t get the title matching the photo. Obviously a hidden mesage there somewhere.', '2005-12-09 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937595, 264962, 38198, '<td valign="top">Wow, good idea.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Wow, good idea.  Nice shot.', '2005-12-09 10:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937598, 264918, 38198, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. Good job!!</td>', 'This is wonderful. Good job!!', '2005-12-09 10:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937600, 265454, 318, '<td valign="top">Very good reflection, almost like a negative.</td>', 'Very good reflection, almost like a negative.', '2005-12-09 10:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937601, 262974, 318, '<td valign="top">A bit dull colours...</td>', 'A bit dull colours...', '2005-12-09 10:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937603, 264871, 318, '<td valign="top">This is great. The shapes, the lights, the background.</td>', 'This is great. The shapes, the lights, the background.', '2005-12-09 10:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937606, 265053, 318, '<td valign="top">Nice. The hard light works here, brings out the texture in the spoon.</td>', 'Nice. The hard light works here, brings out the texture in the spoon.', '2005-12-09 10:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937612, 264884, 49318, '<td valign="top">i like its tones and shadow</td>', 'i like its tones and shadow', '2005-12-09 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937617, 265433, 318, '<td valign="top">Pretty good technically, yet missing something...</td>', 'Pretty good technically, yet missing something...', '2005-12-09 10:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937619, 265453, 48545, '<td valign="top">everything is just a little too dark for me</td>', 'everything is just a little too dark for me', '2005-12-09 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937657, 265479, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the shadow effect very much...bit on the gray side though. Maybe more contrast?</td>', 'Like the shadow effect very much...bit on the gray side though. Maybe more contrast?', '2005-12-09 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937664, 265068, 8891, '<td valign="top">The spoon and fork should be the subject of your image and not an accent to your food face. Some imagination though. The lighting appears uneven.</td>', 'The spoon and fork should be the subject of your image and not an accent to your food face. Some imagination though. The lighting appears uneven.', '2005-12-09 10:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937670, 265461, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very dark, some might say overly so, but I think it adds to what you may have been going for. Sort of wish the glints of light on the fork mid right were not there but you have editing constraints to deal with so OK.  Very intersting, mysterious and well done.</td>', 'Very dark, some might say overly so, but I think it adds to what you may have been going for. Sort of wish the glints of light on the fork mid right were not there but you have editing constraints to deal with so OK.  Very intersting, mysterious and well done.', '2005-12-09 10:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937678, 265313, 8891, '<td valign="top">I do not know under what circumstances you were shooting, but I think if you had gotten closer to the utensils and blurred the background more you would have had a stronger image.</td>', 'I do not know under what circumstances you were shooting, but I think if you had gotten closer to the utensils and blurred the background more you would have had a stronger image.', '2005-12-09 10:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937680, 265377, 35720, '<td valign="top">This is different, I like the angle and the reflection in the knife''s blade. Excellent shot!</td>', 'This is different, I like the angle and the reflection in the knife''s blade. Excellent shot!', '2005-12-09 10:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937681, 265381, 35720, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too dark and the composition might be better IMO. Nice shot though and it meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a bit too dark and the composition might be better IMO. Nice shot though and it meets the challenge.', '2005-12-09 10:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937683, 265458, 35720, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is too small, but it seems to be a nice shot.</td>', 'I''m afraid this is too small, but it seems to be a nice shot.', '2005-12-09 10:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937684, 264599, 8891, '<td valign="top">Awesome motion in the knife you''ve caught. Great detail on the citrus. It appears that the orange might have been pre cut? I would think there would be motion on it as well....so I guess you started the knife motion down and went up? Not sure. Quite intriguing....would like to read about it after.</td>', 'Awesome motion in the knife you''ve caught. Great detail on the citrus. It appears that the orange might have been pre cut? I would think there would be motion on it as well....so I guess you started the knife motion down and went up? Not sure. Quite intriguing....would like to read about it after.', '2005-12-09 10:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937686, 265376, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very nice patterning and perspective. Great tone choice as well.</td>', 'Very nice patterning and perspective. Great tone choice as well.', '2005-12-09 11:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937687, 265210, 35720, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and composition, but I would have liked to see the focus point at the fork itself and maybe with larger DOF.</td>', 'Nice angle and composition, but I would have liked to see the focus point at the fork itself and maybe with larger DOF.', '2005-12-09 11:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937693, 264611, 8891, '<td valign="top">Interesting find and well captured. The composition of the fork figures is very good.  The background, however, is such a grand vista  that I wish the forks were not there. Maybe a different composition of the forks but with a less interesting and beautiful background....maybe just the sky and not the mountains and the lake?</td>', 'Interesting find and well captured. The composition of the fork figures is very good.  The background, however, is such a grand vista  that I wish the forks were not there. Maybe a different composition of the forks but with a less interesting and beautiful background....maybe just the sky and not the mountains and the lake?', '2005-12-09 11:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937696, 265417, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like the set up, the great reflections and the desat. I am not thrilled with the huge black fram nor the pano crop. The subjects seem squeezed into the frame as is . Maybe a bit of an angle and a less confining crop.</td>', 'I like the set up, the great reflections and the desat. I am not thrilled with the huge black fram nor the pano crop. The subjects seem squeezed into the frame as is . Maybe a bit of an angle and a less confining crop.', '2005-12-09 11:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937798, 265297, 47786, '<td valign="top">may be u have very good experience eating hot hot food</td>', 'may be u have very good experience eating hot hot food', '2005-12-09 12:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937813, 265379, 45672, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Nice shot, good lighting.</td>', 'Very creative.  Nice shot, good lighting.', '2005-12-09 12:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937815, 264885, 27482, '<td valign="top">Umm, didn´t know the insides of the earth was a melon :D  Nice job with everything, including the lighting.  Still not as cool as others I have seen that are similar, like scalverts shot with the moon and lightbulb as there he had stars that just made the shot look more "real" and beautiful.  Still very nice in my books and I gave you an 8, good job.</td>', 'Umm, didn´t know the insides of the earth was a melon :D  Nice job with everything, including the lighting.  Still not as cool as others I have seen that are similar, like scalverts shot with the moon and lightbulb as there he had stars that just made the shot look more "real" and beautiful.  Still very nice in my books and I gave you an 8, good job.', '2005-12-09 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937817, 265479, 45672, '<td valign="top">Haha. this is great.  Nice composition and great idea!</td>', 'Haha. this is great.  Nice composition and great idea!', '2005-12-09 12:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937822, 265471, 45672, '<td valign="top">That''s great!  + points for the good laugh.  Way to go.</td>', 'That''s great!  + points for the good laugh.  Way to go.', '2005-12-09 12:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937824, 265456, 45672, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but it looks like you might have a spot on your lense or on the sensor or something.</td>', 'Cool shot, but it looks like you might have a spot on your lense or on the sensor or something.', '2005-12-09 12:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937831, 265251, 45672, '<td valign="top">Cool setup.  Photo is good too.  This needs to be on a poster in a kitchen shop somewhere.</td>', 'Cool setup.  Photo is good too.  This needs to be on a poster in a kitchen shop somewhere.', '2005-12-09 12:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937834, 264962, 45672, '<td valign="top">Interestingly enough, doesn''t SOLO make plastic forks?  Neat idea.</td>', 'Interestingly enough, doesn''t SOLO make plastic forks?  Neat idea.', '2005-12-09 12:23:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1937835, 265369, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect and tone</td>', 'Very nice effect and tone', '2005-12-09 12:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937838, 265469, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, very good trick, took me a second to realize that the "spoon and fork" were a hayfork and a shovel.  Just means that the "plate" looks realistic and so does the cloth under the shovel/hayfork.  Gave this an 8, brought a smile to my face.</td>', 'Haha, very good trick, took me a second to realize that the "spoon and fork" were a hayfork and a shovel.  Just means that the "plate" looks realistic and so does the cloth under the shovel/hayfork.  Gave this an 8, brought a smile to my face.', '2005-12-09 12:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937842, 264919, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, what a scary pirate :D  Only thing missing is a white shirt amd a red jacket and he could be in "pirates of the curry bean (reference to the kutlery ofcourse)"</td>', 'Haha, what a scary pirate :D  Only thing missing is a white shirt amd a red jacket and he could be in "pirates of the curry bean (reference to the kutlery ofcourse)"', '2005-12-09 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937847, 264918, 27482, '<td valign="top">I dunno, I have to say that it´s very hard to see what is in the picture if I didn´t know what the theme of the challenge was about, I probably would have guessed this to be rose petals if this had been in the free study.  Anyway, like the colour, other than that pretty mediocre so I gave it a mediocre score of 5...</td>', 'I dunno, I have to say that it´s very hard to see what is in the picture if I didn´t know what the theme of the challenge was about, I probably would have guessed this to be rose petals if this had been in the free study.  Anyway, like the colour, other than that pretty mediocre so I gave it a mediocre score of 5...', '2005-12-09 12:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937851, 265109, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good composition, love the colours in it and good moment.  Only to nitpick, I would have liked some more texture in the bee but other than that, awesome.  Gave it an 8.</td>', 'Nice shot, good composition, love the colours in it and good moment.  Only to nitpick, I would have liked some more texture in the bee but other than that, awesome.  Gave it an 8.', '2005-12-09 12:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937870, 265248, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and angle of the sun vessel, love the colour composition, looks to have been a very nice sunset.</td>', 'Nice shot and angle of the sun vessel, love the colour composition, looks to have been a very nice sunset.', '2005-12-09 12:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937876, 264290, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have to say that to me this is a very poor selection of DOF.  Nothing really seems to be in good focus, neither the end part of the spoons or the part with the stuff in it so it just doesn´t work like this.  Seems your focus point is somewhere on the handle of the spoons...  Also not really understanding why you cut off parts of the end of the spoons and have so much space up in the left corner, I would have had all the parts of the spoons in the frame.  On the positive side it seems well exposed and wb looks correct, a bit flat though, could use some more contrast.  Couldn´t bring myself to give a higher rating than a 4 even though it´s obviously on topic...</td>', 'I have to say that to me this is a very poor selection of DOF.  Nothing really seems to be in good focus, neither the end part of the spoons or the part with the stuff in it so it just doesn´t work like this.  Seems your focus point is somewhere on the handle of the spoons...  Also not really understanding why you cut off parts of the end of the spoons and have so much space up in the left corner, I would have had all the parts of the spoons in the frame.  On the positive side it seems well exposed and wb looks correct, a bit flat though, could use some more contrast.  Couldn´t bring myself to give a higher rating than a 4 even though it´s obviously on topic...', '2005-12-09 12:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937881, 265468, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the smoke, without it the shot would just be slightly above average.  Nice job on the lighting too.  (7)</td>', 'Love the smoke, without it the shot would just be slightly above average.  Nice job on the lighting too.  (7)', '2005-12-09 12:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1937884, 264727, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job on freezing the action, however the shot is either very soft or just out of focus and that drags it down a notch.  Still better than most shots in the challenge, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Nice job on freezing the action, however the shot is either very soft or just out of focus and that drags it down a notch.  Still better than most shots in the challenge, gave it a 6.', '2005-12-09 12:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
