(1938037, 265473, 10634, '<td valign="top">Someone else did this same thing and I liked theirs better because the fork didn''t hang so far out of the mouth. It looked more natural with just the tines hanging out. You couldn''t tell that it was being held by her teeth like you can in yours. He is obviously biting it. If his mouth were closed a little more around the handle, that would help a bit. I like the grain and color though!</td>', 'Someone else did this same thing and I liked theirs better because the fork didn''t hang so far out of the mouth. It looked more natural with just the tines hanging out. You couldn''t tell that it was being held by her teeth like you can in yours. He is obviously biting it. If his mouth were closed a little more around the handle, that would help a bit. I like the grain and color though!', '2005-12-09 14:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1938044, 265379, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The way the fork sits in her mouth it looks very natural. I also like this in black and white. For some reason I don''t think it would have the same impact in color. Only complaint is that I think the focus should be on her mouth not her eyes.</td>', 'Very nice. The way the fork sits in her mouth it looks very natural. I also like this in black and white. For some reason I don''t think it would have the same impact in color. Only complaint is that I think the focus should be on her mouth not her eyes.', '2005-12-09 14:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
