(1941585, 265379, 47030, '<td valign="top">Why B&amp;W? I bet she has the most interesting eyes.  Normally B&amp;W is used when the color does nothing to help the shot.  Anyway good shot very sharp focus on the eyes.  8</td>', 'Why B&W? I bet she has the most interesting eyes.  Normally B&W is used when the color does nothing to help the shot.  Anyway good shot very sharp focus on the eyes.  8', '2005-12-11 04:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
