(1942289, 264290, 8891, '<td valign="top">I''m a little confused by where you want me to look. The composition of the spoons and their contents suggest that I should be looking towards the filled spoons....but they are not in focus. My eye goes beyond them and there is nothing there except sort of a shadow of what appears to be a spatula and it is not in focus either nor totally in the frame.</td>', 'I''m a little confused by where you want me to look. The composition of the spoons and their contents suggest that I should be looking towards the filled spoons....but they are not in focus. My eye goes beyond them and there is nothing there except sort of a shadow of what appears to be a spatula and it is not in focus either nor totally in the frame.', '2005-12-11 15:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
