(1942551, 264909, 36231, '<td valign="top">Wow, just perfect!  Definitely a top 10 IMO. I love the way you captured the curves of the spoons in an elegant way.  Did you convert to greytone?  The contrast is perfect here. Can''t wait to see who took this one! :)</td>', 'Wow, just perfect!  Definitely a top 10 IMO. I love the way you captured the curves of the spoons in an elegant way.  Did you convert to greytone?  The contrast is perfect here. Can''t wait to see who took this one! :)', '2005-12-11 17:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
