(1942557, 265373, 36231, '<td valign="top">It seems slightly OOF, however, I think it''s more your DOF. I really like it, tho.  Simple and clean. Great job. GL! :)</td>', 'It seems slightly OOF, however, I think it''s more your DOF. I really like it, tho.  Simple and clean. Great job. GL! :)', '2005-12-11 17:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
