(1943920, 265469, 3306, '<td valign="top">Your son looks like he really had fun with this shot. What a great idea! I was very surprised it did not ribbon. Congratulations on this wonderful piece of art and a top 6 finish.</td>', 'Your son looks like he really had fun with this shot. What a great idea! I was very surprised it did not ribbon. Congratulations on this wonderful piece of art and a top 6 finish.', '2005-12-12 05:53:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943921, 265002, 3306, '<td valign="top">A beautifully colorful and creative idea. Congratulations on your 4th place finish.</td>', 'A beautifully colorful and creative idea. Congratulations on your 4th place finish.', '2005-12-12 05:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943923, 265445, 28742, '<td valign="top">Shoulda known this was yours, bear. Well done. I gave it a 6. Shoulda done better, but it was a rather lame challenge all the way around.</td>', 'Shoulda known this was yours, bear. Well done. I gave it a 6. Shoulda done better, but it was a rather lame challenge all the way around.', '2005-12-12 05:57:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943924, 265251, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 5 finish. A very unique and creative composition worthy of a ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 5 finish. A very unique and creative composition worthy of a ribbon.', '2005-12-12 05:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943925, 263718, 25355, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on making the top 20 with this. I gave it a 10, without even getting The Matrix link (never having seen the movie, though I saw some of Reloaded).) At first glance,  I thought the reflection on the sppon was blood, but of course, it''s his fingers.</td>', 'Congratulations on making the top 20 with this. I gave it a 10, without even getting The Matrix link (never having seen the movie, though I saw some of Reloaded).) At first glance,  I thought the reflection on the sppon was blood, but of course, it''s his fingers.', '2005-12-12 05:59:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943928, 265248, 25355, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this, I knew it was that sculpture in Iceland that has been featured before, and a few votes later I saw gsal''s. Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'When I first saw this, I knew it was that sculpture in Iceland that has been featured before, and a few votes later I saw gsal''s. Nice composition and lighting.', '2005-12-12 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943929, 265358, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Is that part of the spoon just below the curves and above the shaft? A really neat idea.</td>', 'Love the colors. Is that part of the spoon just below the curves and above the shaft? A really neat idea.', '2005-12-12 06:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1943930, 264599, 3306, '<td valign="top">You remind me of my 7th grade science teacher. He would always keep us captivated with fascinating scientific experiments. He would tell us the result and make us try to figure out how he did it. I see your pictures in the challenges and try to guess your technique. I am always amused by your pictures.</td>', 'You remind me of my 7th grade science teacher. He would always keep us captivated with fascinating scientific experiments. He would tell us the result and make us try to figure out how he did it. I see your pictures in the challenges and try to guess your technique. I am always amused by your pictures.', '2005-12-12 06:08:28.000000', NULL, 0);
