(1944376, 265380, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, here is an image whose placement I highly question. It should have finished in the top five. It is a creative and clever composition and very well executed. One can not just look at the image and forget it. If I were forced to give one honorable mention it would be this image.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your top 20 finish. Smashing work.</td>', 'Now, here is an image whose placement I highly question. It should have finished in the top five. It is a creative and clever composition and very well executed. One can not just look at the image and forget it. If I were forced to give one honorable mention it would be this image. Congratulations on your top 20 finish. Smashing work.', '2005-12-12 11:12:27.000000', NULL, 0),
