(1944408, 265413, 22734, '<td valign="top">Another outstanding display of creativity. Falling just a tad on technique, yet the clever take should have placed this image much, much higher. Ken, keep up the good work, this talent does pay off.</td>', 'Another outstanding display of creativity. Falling just a tad on technique, yet the clever take should have placed this image much, much higher. Ken, keep up the good work, this talent does pay off.', '2005-12-12 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
