(1945558, 263534, 21714, '<td valign="top">I thought it was one of the best in the challenge. It made me stop and think about the message. When I saw the stuff in the spoon, it made me realize what it''s about. I thought you did a really good job with this image.<br/>I haven''t actually seen anyone else express it like you have done and that''s one of the reasons why I like it so much. It''s refreshing and it''s great.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I thought it was one of the best in the challenge. It made me stop and think about the message. When I saw the stuff in the spoon, it made me realize what it''s about. I thought you did a really good job with this image.I haven''t actually seen anyone else express it like you have done and that''s one of the reasons why I like it so much. It''s refreshing and it''s great. ', '2005-12-12 20:04:55.000000', NULL, 0),
