(1945665, 265241, 16230, '<td valign="top">No surprise here. Yet another Dax- masterpiece! Only you can make a fork look this beautiful. You really have an eye for color and form.</td>', 'No surprise here. Yet another Dax- masterpiece! Only you can make a fork look this beautiful. You really have an eye for color and form.', '2005-12-12 20:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1945670, 265469, 44287, '<td valign="top">You were robbed! I personally think this is much better than the yellow and red, and possibly even the blue. I''m amazed it didn''t ribbon- it''s brilliant! And it reminds me of the old ''Honey I Shrunk the Kids'' movies... :)</td>', 'You were robbed! I personally think this is much better than the yellow and red, and possibly even the blue. I''m amazed it didn''t ribbon- it''s brilliant! And it reminds me of the old ''Honey I Shrunk the Kids'' movies... :)', '2005-12-12 20:54:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1945691, 265469, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  I figured this was you - you''re good!  I''m going to have to study your pictures.  I like the soft colours in this one, it suits this picture well.  Your little boy has a very endearing smile.</td>', 'Congratulations!  I figured this was you - you''re good!  I''m going to have to study your pictures.  I like the soft colours in this one, it suits this picture well.  Your little boy has a very endearing smile.', '2005-12-12 21:05:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1945692, 265241, 16230, '<td valign="top">I think that this image is so much better than all of the ribbon winners in this challenge that it just isn''t funny. You should have several ribbons to your credit. The fact that you haven''t any yet just points out how bad the voting is here. It really makes me wonder if the votes are manipulated in some way. Anyway, keep up the great work. Lots of us here love what you do.<br/></td>', 'I think that this image is so much better than all of the ribbon winners in this challenge that it just isn''t funny. You should have several ribbons to your credit. The fact that you haven''t any yet just points out how bad the voting is here. It really makes me wonder if the votes are manipulated in some way. Anyway, keep up the great work. Lots of us here love what you do.', '2005-12-12 21:05:59.000000', NULL, 0),
