(1946246, 265445, 5885, '<td valign="top">Robert, I can''t figure out why, but the knife just doesn''t look sharp to me. The edges appear soft.  I can tell it''s in focus because the "Santoku" is sharp.</td>', 'Robert, I can''t figure out why, but the knife just doesn''t look sharp to me. The edges appear soft.  I can tell it''s in focus because the "Santoku" is sharp.', '2005-12-13 00:24:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1946251, 265445, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fotomann_forever:</b></div><hr/><i> Robert, I can''t figure out why, but the knife just doesn''t look sharp to me. The edges appear soft.  I can tell it''s in focus because the "Santoku" is sharp. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>A "glow layer" has been applied to everything but the kinfe, and the interaction between glow and not-glow is a "soft" one.</td>', 'Originally posted by fotomann_forever: Robert, I can''t figure out why, but the knife just doesn''t look sharp to me. The edges appear soft.  I can tell it''s in focus because the "Santoku" is sharp.   A "glow layer" has been applied to everything but the kinfe, and the interaction between glow and not-glow is a "soft" one.', '2005-12-13 00:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1946269, 263067, 42392, '<td valign="top">i apologize for the blur i was trying for a diff. effect to make the photo look like a still life painting. this is another one of those deals that you think it looks great -just can''t get everyone else to see what i see. thanks for the comments-good or bad i always appreciate every comment.</td>', 'i apologize for the blur i was trying for a diff. effect to make the photo look like a still life painting. this is another one of those deals that you think it looks great -just can''t get everyone else to see what i see. thanks for the comments-good or bad i always appreciate every comment.', '2005-12-13 00:52:07.000000', NULL, 0),
