(1967416, 265477, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interesting visual that pulls the eye and holds it. May not be grasped in one stare and certainly too artistic for a voting crowd that devotes less than 15-30 seconds per image.</td>', 'A very interesting visual that pulls the eye and holds it. May not be grasped in one stare and certainly too artistic for a voting crowd that devotes less than 15-30 seconds per image.', '2005-12-21 09:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1967454, 265454, 37719, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot!  The colors in the reflection are incredible and the contrast between that and the far shore is exquisite!  The ''divining rod'' is excellent as well being the only true color tree.  Very well done in my opinion.  Shows a lot of creativity and thought.  The composition is well done - ratio of subject to overall scene.  Placement of the subject bothered me at first, but when you take in the whole shot and pair it with it''s reflection, the impact is much stronger.  Should have done much better, again my opinion.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot!  The colors in the reflection are incredible and the contrast between that and the far shore is exquisite!  The ''divining rod'' is excellent as well being the only true color tree.  Very well done in my opinion.  Shows a lot of creativity and thought.  The composition is well done - ratio of subject to overall scene.  Placement of the subject bothered me at first, but when you take in the whole shot and pair it with it''s reflection, the impact is much stronger.  Should have done much better, again my opinion.  Well done!', '2005-12-21 09:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1972092, 264909, 23394, '<td valign="top">whadayano...i popped this one a 10.  this is right up there with <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=50152" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ed''s</a>.  excellent work, something i hope to be able to replicate myself.</td>', 'whadayano...i popped this one a 10.  this is right up there with ed''s.  excellent work, something i hope to be able to replicate myself.', '2005-12-22 19:27:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1973381, 265461, 14614, '<td valign="top">Your use of "just off" blacks and whites plays well with this one but ultimately this picture is about light and shadow for me.  The speck of light in the eye, the shadow to fill in... wonderful.<br/> <br/>(side note: what''s a character filter?)</td>', 'Your use of "just off" blacks and whites plays well with this one but ultimately this picture is about light and shadow for me.  The speck of light in the eye, the shadow to fill in... wonderful. (side note: what''s a character filter?)', '2005-12-23 07:25:56.000000', NULL, 0),
